SUMMARY:Chinatown (1974)
DESCRIPTION:Classic screening. Regal Graceville: Sat 26 September. New Farm
  Cinemas: Sun 27 September. In this seminal noir from 1975\, Jack Nicholso
 n is unforgettable as private eye Jake Gittes\, living off the murky moral
  climate of sunbaked pre-war Southern California. Hired by a beautiful soc
 ialite (Faye Dunaway) to investigate her husband’s extra-marital affair\
 , Gittes is swept into a maelstrom of double dealings and deadly deceits a
 s he uncovers a web of personal and political scandals that come crashing 
 together in one unforgettable night.
LOCATION:New Farm Cinemas\, 701 Brunswick St\, New Farm
